(ii) In the event of the petitioners' arrest, the Investigating Officer shall release the petitioners on bail on them executing a bond for Rs.50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent BAIL APPL. NO. 8119 OF 2024 2024:KER:83504 sureties each for the like amount each;
(iii) The petitioners shall appear before the Investigating Officer for two days from the date of their release.
They shall then appear before the Investigating Officer, as and when directed;

